{{ 'pm-bs-base.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- comment -%}
  FUEL_06 fragrance finder, homepage band. Sits right after the benefits row, which is where the design puts it.

  The copy is in theme settings (Theme settings > FUEL_06 Fragrance finder),
  shared with the product page dialog that layout/theme.liquid renders, so one
  edit changes both. This section only places the band.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  MAGYX colours on the homepage band and its dialog (magicperfume.co design, 14.11): black buttons, step numbers,
  add buttons and focus rings, Pine accent word / links / saving pill, silver tints instead of the greens and cream.
  Scoped to this section (id selector beats the single-class rules in fuel06-finder.css); the product page dialog
  rendered from layout/theme.liquid keeps the stylesheet's colours.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- style -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .fuel06-finder {
    --f06-green: #184031;
    --f06-btn: #100f0d;
    --f06-check: #184031;
    --f06-plus: #100f0d;
    --f06-flask: #184031;
    --f06-how: rgba(199, 201, 203, 0.3);
    --f06-note: rgba(199, 201, 203, 0.3);
    --f06-chip: rgba(199, 201, 203, 0.3);
    --f06-save-cell: rgba(24, 64, 49, 0.08);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .fuel06-finder__dialog {
    --f06-surface: #ffffff;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .fuel06-finder__cta,
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .fuel06-finder__step-n {
    background: #100f0d;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .fuel06-finder__add {
    border-color: #100f0d;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .fuel06-finder :focus-visible,
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .fuel06-finder__band-field:focus-within {
    outline-color: #100f0d;
  }
{%- endstyle -%}
{% render 'fuel06-finder'
  , mode: 'assets' %}
{% render 'fuel06-finder'
  , mode: 'home' %}

{% schema %}
  {
    "name": "FUEL_06 Fragrance finder",
    "settings": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "The wording is in Theme settings > FUEL_06 Fragrance finder."
      }
    ],
    "enabled_on": {
      "templates": ["index"]
    },
    "presets": [
      {
        "name": "FUEL_06 Fragrance finder"
      }
    ]
  }
{% endschema %}